assert x <= 2: consistent
propagate: [2, 5]
explain x <= 5: [1, 2]
check: consistent, model x = 0
assert x >= 3 at level 2: consistent
check: conflict [1, 5]
backtrack to 1, check: consistent, shared []
log of 5 steps: checked
refused-function.smt2: unreadable
sat-interval.smt2: lg_check refuted; interface refuted
unsat-bounds.smt2: lg_check proved; interface proved, log of 5 steps checked
disjunctions-03.smt2: lg_check refuted; interface refuted
disjunctions-04.smt2: lg_check proved; interface proved, log of 33 steps checked
